sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent / face
  participant G as Gate — Allow(q)
  participant M as MHS core
  participant I as Device interlock
  participant Ad as Adapter
  participant Dev as Device
  participant J as Journal
  A->>G: request (capability, args)
  G->>G: eight conjuncts
  G-->>A: admission for this exact request digest
  G->>J: admitted
  A->>M: set(capability, args, admission)
  M->>M: verify the admission — MHS cannot mint one
  M->>I: device policy check
  alt interlock refuses
    I-->>A: INTERLOCK_REJECTED
  else allowed
    I->>Ad: write
    Ad->>Dev: protocol frame
    Dev-->>Ad: response
    Ad->>Dev: read back
    Ad-->>A: done, verified by read-back
  end
